        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Poaching keeps the chicken moist and pulls no flavour away from the dressing. Do not boil it hard: a very gentle simmer with the lid on is all you need." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
